## Local setup

Requires Node 20.11+, npm 10+, and PostgreSQL 14+.

```bash
# 1. Install
npm install

# 2. Configure
cp .env.example .env
#    Fill in DATABASE_URL. The development JWT secrets work as-is locally.

# 3. Create the database
createdb {{snakeCase applicationName}}_dev

# 4. Apply migrations and seed roles and permissions
npm run db:migrate
npm run db:seed

# 5. Run
npm run dev
```

{{#if includeApi}}
The API listens on **http://localhost:{{port}}** with docs at `/docs`.
{{/if}}
{{#if includeAdmin}}
The admin console runs on **http://localhost:{{adminPort}}**
(`npm run dev -w {{packageName}}-admin`).
{{/if}}

