## Security notes

- Every route declares a permission; undeclared routes are denied.
- Tenant scope comes from the access token, never from the request.
- Cross-tenant reads report `not_found`, never `forbidden`.
- Sensitive actions are written to an append-only audit trail with actor,
  organization, before/after, request id, IP and user agent.
- Production error responses carry no message, stack or class from an
  unexpected error.
- Never commit a `.env`, and never put a secret in a `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variable.

See [docs/security.md](docs/security.md), and read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before
pointing an AI coding agent at this repository.

